# Deny everything, then allow only what the api image copies. The build context is the repo root
# (api/Dockerfile is built with `docker build -f api/Dockerfile .`), which holds a venv, data,
# the frontend and 32 GB of nnUNet checkpoints under api/docker/.
*
!api
!morphometry
!VERSION
# Re-deny runtime state, checkpoints, secrets and bytecode inside the allowed trees.
api/data
api/logs
api/docker
api/.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
